(2) The processed time series in (1) was passed through the
GRU module for feature extraction. The advantages
of GRU are mainly as follows. First, the temporal feature
extraction network can extract the variation characteristics
of the time series in both temporal and spatial dimensions
from multiple dimensions. Second, the feature extraction
network based on the gated recurrent unit is more
