3.3 Noise reduction of water quality data
by wavelet transform
Before feeding the time series into the noise reduction network,
this paper ﬁrst used Pearson ’s coefﬁcients on the sensor data to see
their feature correlation to determine if there was redundancy in the
original data. The correlation heat map between the features is
shown in Figure 7 , and the formula for Pearson ’s correlation
coefﬁcient is shown in Equation (23) .
r(x, y)= cov(X, Y)
