mainly due to abiotic stress generated by extremities in pH, salinity,
temperature, dissolved oxygen (DO), acidity, pollution load,etc.
(Masson et al., 2002; Moon et al., 2003; Wu et al., 2018; Bernhardt
et al., 2020; Song and Choi, 2021; Booth et al., 2023). The primary
