and marine species from hatchery to grow-out is reared in RAS. RAS
have been used for several decades for fish production, although only a
few very large (production over 10 million kg per year) systems are in
operation (Molleda,2007).
The idea of RAS originates from Japanese biological purification in
the 1960s (Wu et al.,2008;L i n ,2011; Xiao et al.,2019). Since the
