for measuring suspended particles, an analogue DO meter and an
analogue pH Meter.
Santos et al. (2022) reported a pilot design of electrochemical oxida-
tion of ammonium nitrogen in marine RAS water rearing gilthead sea
bream (Sparus aurata)a n ds e ab a s s(Dicentrarchus labrax). They mea-
