cleaners, and sweepers, etc. These people will be helpful in reducing waste from various 
sources. Special awareness programs must be created for farmers to showcase the harmful 
effects of excessive usage of agrochemicals in farming. Guidance should be given to the people 
living on the banks of seashore or rivers to test the fishes for the presence of heavy metals prior 
to consumption. Regular testing of the water sources shall be carried out by responsible 
